OCWORLD 1
NAME Range
SUN elev 48.0 azim 130.0 color 1 0.97 0.92 lux 90000
SKY model physical
# The game mode. Placed like anything else -- a graph class is a class, so it is placed, not
# registered by some separate mechanism.
PLACE none 0 0 0 0 0 0 1 class AN_Rules
# The player. Parented to Character, so this placement gets a real capsule and view.
PLACE none 0 0 100 0 0 0 1 class AN_Player
# Two targets from ONE graph file, to show their hit counts stay independent.
PLACE none 300 400 60 0 0 0 1 class AN_Target
PLACE none -300 400 60 0 0 0 1 class AN_Target
